        "slc_b06f90fe678767a343198324acaa4ce32f31d5497a2d8a1d5befefa899388845"
      ],
      "text": "Agents take work from a shared SQLite task queue on one host, report up an org chart, hand work to each other, and escalate to a human via Telegram only when a decision is needed."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
