        "slc_cbf507fbe5d88a982cdf051800d503dfb01edf46bca6a6da24dd22037b63649b"
      ],
      "text": "The 5dive CLI exposes verbs for agent lifecycle (create/start/stop/logs/config), tasks, goals, loops, council, trace, run metrics, memory search, triggers, heartbeat, org, ui, account, and team import; every command accepts --json with an {ok,data}/{ok:false,error} envelope and exit codes matching error.code."
    },
