        "slc_886f691c023212cb8b59f16beb8bb1d8ebb3e653532a3882a411f7e956c1bb30"
      ],
      "text": "Each agent runs as its own Linux user under one of three isolation tiers: standard (shared read, limited write), admin (full host, auto-granted to the first agent on a fresh box), or sandboxed (own home, no sudo, systemd resource limits)."
    },
