        "slc_ecb26c8b39050217fa13ccc34871362625272f69a2e6ca5f89cd7a2f4d7b181c"
      ],
      "text": "Delegated git push uses the operator's own GitHub App: the agent never holds a token; pushes are gate-gated on a human- or reviewer-cleared ship gate, restricted to one non-protected branch, and executed in a root-only helper with a repo-scoped short-lived token."
    },
