        "slc_1f1adae6ad6d494074bdd9d2fa7575e5d39184d24f822f02f2e5279297e6ae38"
      ],
      "text": "Governance policy can be loaded from a constitution.yaml in the state dir (or FIVEDIVE_CONSTITUTION_FILE); if the file is absent or malformed the loader falls back atomically to shipped defaults and never applies a partial document."
    },
